00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.810
So we have these [INAUDIBLE].

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:10.740
GPUs are now available for
Google Compute Engine and Cloud

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:11.520
Machine Learning.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.530
MARK: Currently,
we have NVIDIA GPUs

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:15.530
